# UI (ui/)

## Dev

- Vite **5173**; API base `/api/v2` in `src/api.js` (proxied to `127.0.0.1:9082`)
- Start: `make ui` from repo root
- HMR for React; backend changes need svc restart/`svc-watch`

## Structure

- `src/pages/` — HomePage, SessionPage (stage router)
- `src/components/stages/` — Intake, Parse, Reconcile, Examine, Signoff panels
- `src/hooks/` — `useSse`, `useStageProgress`, data hooks
- Pipeline progress from SSE events + `session.status`

## Stage UX notes

- **Intake** shows "classifying" while `status === 'INTAKE'`
- **Parse** meter uses `ExtractionProgress` events after `StageStarted{parse}`
- Presets: `GET /api/v2/presets` — requires svc up + `test/cases` mounted

## Styling

- Tailwind CSS; financial/workbench density — match existing components in `components/ui/`
